OL,3,GNEWSAAll's well that ends well for
OL,4,Asilly sausage Minnie
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog owner has showered the fire
OL,7,Fservice and farmers with praise after
OL,8,Fthey rescued her dog from an
OL,9,Funderground drainage pipe.
OL,11,FMallerie Maddison was taking Minnie,
OL,12,Fher seven-year-old dachshund, on their
OL,13,Fusual morning walk in a field in
OL,14,FKirmington, North Lincolnshire, when
OL,15,Fthe dog disappeared.
OL,17,FShe heard barking from an underground
OL,18,Fpipe, and called farmers and fire crews
OL,19,Ffor help. After a four-hour operation,
OL,20,FMinnie was returned to safety.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
