OL,3,GNEWSAAll's well that ends well for
OL,4,Asilly sausage Minnie
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the ordeal, which she
OL,7,Fdescribed as "another chapter in
OL,8,FMinnie's epic adventures", Mallerie
OL,9,Fsaid she was "so grateful to the team
OL,10,Ffor helping retrieve her safely and
OL,11,Funharmed".
